        "text": "Hi, I'm Leo, and welcome to my channel, Tech for Students. Today I compare two laptops: the ByteBook 14 and the NovaBook 15. The NovaBook is cheaper, and today it has a ten percent discount. Its screen is bigger, too. But the ByteBook is faster, and it is lighter: only one point two kilos. For students, a light laptop is better, because you carry it to class every day. The reviews for the ByteBook are better, too. So, my recommendation? If you have the money, buy the ByteBook. If not, the NovaBook is a good choice. Thanks for watching, and subscribe for more reviews!"
